title: "AIMMD: AI for Molecular Mechanism Discovery"
abstract: >-
  AI-enhanced path sampling for rare molecular transitions: committor-guided
  two-way shooting, on-the-fly committor-model training, and reweighting of the
  resulting path ensemble into free energies and transition rates.
